###Block: Descriptions
Aganazzar's Scorcher.MOD	DESC:Path of fire deals 1d8/2 levels.
Elminster's Evasion.MOD	DESC:Enhanced Contingency spell teleports you under six possible conditions.
Gate Seal.MOD	DESC:Permanently seals a Gate or Portal.
Shout (Great).MOD	DESC:See text
Grimwald's Graymantle.MOD	DESC:Target is prevented from regaining hit points by any means.
Snilloc's Snowball Swarm.MOD	DESC:Deals 1d6/2 levels cold damage in a 10-ft radius.
